       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SEARCH-ALL-DEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 ACCOUNT-TABLE.
          05 ACCOUNT-DETAIL OCCURS 4 TIMES
             ASCENDING KEY IS ACCOUNT-TYPE
             INDEXED BY ACCOUNT-INDEX.
             10 ACCOUNT-TYPE PIC X(8).
             10 INTEREST-RATE PIC 99.
       01 SEARCH-TYPE PIC X(8) VALUE "SAVINGS".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE "CURRENT 00" TO ACCOUNT-DETAIL(1).
           MOVE "FD      07" TO ACCOUNT-DETAIL(2).
           MOVE "RD      06" TO ACCOUNT-DETAIL(3).
           MOVE "SAVINGS 04" TO ACCOUNT-DETAIL(4).
           SEARCH ALL ACCOUNT-DETAIL
               AT END DISPLAY "ACCOUNT TYPE NOT FOUND"
               WHEN ACCOUNT-TYPE(ACCOUNT-INDEX) = SEARCH-TYPE
                   DISPLAY "INTEREST RATE: "
                           INTEREST-RATE(ACCOUNT-INDEX)
           END-SEARCH.
           STOP RUN.
